flowchart LR
    U[End Users] --> FE[Next.js Frontend\npackages/frontend]
    FE --> BE[Node.js Backend API\npackages/backend]

    BE --> AUTH[Auth and Tenant Boundaries]
    BE --> CHAT[Chat and Streaming Pipeline]
    BE --> UPLOAD[File Upload and Extraction]
    BE --> ADMIN[Admin and Diagnostics]

    CHAT --> AI[AI Provider Abstraction\nOpenAI, Anthropic, Deepgram, ElevenLabs]

    BE --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    BE --> REDIS[(Redis)]

    DEV[Local Infra\nDocker Compose] --> PG
    DEV --> REDIS

    CI[Deployment Target\nVercel or Container Runtime] --> FE
    CI --> BE
